# Copy to .env (which git ignores) and fill in. Treat the URL like a password.
# The pit channel's incoming webhook, from Discord, Slack or Mattermost; see docs/webhooks.md.
# Discord: the pit channel's settings > Integrations > Webhooks > New Webhook > Copy Webhook URL.
# (DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL, the old name, still works.)
PIT_WEBHOOK_URL=
